    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to eliminating the\nelectronic death registration system fee for funeral directors and\nundertakers; and to repeal provisions of such law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S3009",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3009-2023",
